## Bootstrap

1. Place `agent-kit-client` at repo root (or set path).
2. `powershell -File agent-kit-client/scripts/bootstrap-client.ps1 -HostName claude-code`
3. Edit `.cursor/agent-kit-license.json` (key + licenseApi).
4. `powershell -File agent-kit-client/scripts/sync-entitled.ps1 -HostName claude-code`

## MCP

`.mcp.json` should include `agent-kit-client` pointing at:

`agent-kit-client/mcp/agent-kit-client/index.mjs`

Reload Claude Code MCP after bootstrap.

